  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "당신이 마티에르 씨의\n대리인이군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7740020B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528C758000AB300B9ACC778C774AD70C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 바로\n제 의뢰를 들어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020BC14B85C000AC81C0020C758B8B0B97C0020B4E4C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전 포켓몬의 진화에 관심이 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8040020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020C9C4D654C5D00020AD00C2ECC7740020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 진화가 뭔지는 알고 계시죠?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n싸워서 경험치를 얻거나\n사이가 좋아지거나 하면<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n진화해서 모습이 변하고 강해진답니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "진화 방법에는 여러 가지가 있는데\n저는 도구를 통한 진화에 관심이 있거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C4D6540020BC29BC95C5D0B2940020C5ECB7EC0020AC00C9C0AC000020C788B294B370000AC800B2940020B3C4AD6CB97C0020D1B5D55C0020C9C4D654C5D00020AD00C2ECC7740020C788AC70B4E0C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 그런 제 손에\n바로 이 ‘천둥의돌’이 들어왔단 말이죠!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020ADF8B7F00020C81C0020C190C5D0000ABC14B85C0020C77400202018CC9CB465C758B3CC2019C7740020B4E4C5B4C654B2E80020B9D0C774C8E00021002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 슬프게도 전...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020C2ACD504AC8CB3C40020C804002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "천둥의돌로 진화하는\n포켓몬을 데리고 있지 않아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC9CB465C758B3CCB85C0020C9C4D654D558B294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020B370B9ACACE00020C788C9C00020C54AC544C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조사해 보니 피카츄라는 포켓몬이\n천둥의돌로 진화한다더라구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870C0ACD5740020BCF4B2C80020D53CCE74CE04B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774000ACC9CB465C758B3CCB85C0020C9C4D654D55CB2E4B354B77CAD6CC694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기서부터가 본론인데요,\n저에게 피카츄를 주실 수 있나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C11CBD80D130AC000020BCF8B860C778B370C694002C000AC800C5D0AC8C0020D53CCE74CE04B97C0020C8FCC2E40020C2180020C788B098C694003F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론 대가 없이 달라고 하는 건 아니에요!\n대신 헤라크로스를 드릴게요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n즉, 포켓몬 교환을 하자는 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB8600020B300AC000020C5C6C7740020B2ECB77CACE00020D558B2940020AC740020C544B2C8C5D0C6940021000AB300C2E00020D5E4B77CD06CB85CC2A4B97C0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002E00100001BE00000AC989002C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020AD50D658C7440020D558C790B2940020AC70C608C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저에게 피카츄를 주실 수 있나요?\n대신 헤라크로스를 드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n피카츄는\n3번 와일드 존에 있다고 들었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C5D0AC8C0020D53CCE74CE04B97C0020C8FCC2E40020C2180020C788B098C694003F000AB300C2E00020D5E4B77CD06CB85CC2A4B97C0020B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100001BE01000AD53CCE74CE04B294000A0033BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D00020C788B2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "호, 혹시\n피카츄를 데리고 계신 건가요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n괜찮다면\n제 헤라크로스와 교환해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D638002C0020D639C2DC000AD53CCE74CE04B97C0020B370B9ACACE00020ACC4C2E00020AC74AC00C694003F00100001BE01000AAD1CCC2EB2E4BA74000AC81C0020D5E4B77CD06CB85CC2A4C6400020AD50D658D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 의뢰를 듣고도 교환하지 않는다고요?\n피카츄를 그냥 자랑하러 오신 건가요...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020C758B8B0B97C0020B4E3ACE0B3C40020AD50D658D558C9C00020C54AB294B2E4ACE0C694003F000AD53CCE74CE04B97C0020ADF8B0E50020C790B791D558B7EC0020C624C2E00020AC74AC00C694002E002E002E003F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사해요!\n그럼 지금 바로 교환해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10C0ACD574C6940021000AADF8B7FC0020C9C0AE080020BC14B85C0020AD50D658D574C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어서 와! 피카츄!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C11C0020C64000210020D53CCE74CE04002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "함께하게 된 기념으로\n천둥의돌을 사용해 줄게~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D568AED8D558AC8C0020B41C0020AE30B150C73CB85C000ACC9CB465C758B3CCC7440020C0ACC6A9D5740020C904AC8C007E002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "피카츄가\n라이츄가 됐어요~!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D53CCE74CE04AC00000AB77CC774CE04AC000020B410C5B4C694007E002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 포켓몬 도감의 설명에 따르면\n라이츄는...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전기가 모이면 공격적이게 되어\n트레이너를 습격할지도 모른다고...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D3ECCF13BAAC0020B3C4AC10C7580020C124BA85C5D00020B530B974BA74000AB77CC774CE04B294002E002E002E00100001BE01000AC804AE30AC000020BAA8C774BA740020ACF5ACA9C801C774AC8C0020B418C5B4000AD2B8B808C774B108B97C0020C2B5ACA9D560C9C0B3C40020BAA8B978B2E4ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으~음... 천둥의돌 외에도\n포켓몬을 진화시키는 돌은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n여러 가지가 있다나 봐요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73C007EC74C002E002E002E0020CC9CB465C758B3CC0020C678C5D0B3C4000AD3ECCF13BAACC7440020C9C4D654C2DCD0A4B2940020B3CCC74000100001BE00000AC5ECB7EC0020AC00C9C0AC000020C788B2E4B0980020BD10C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아, 아무튼 감사해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544002C0020C544BB34D2BC0020AC10C0ACD574C694002E00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마티에르 씨에게도 안부 전해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528C5D0AC8CB3C40020C548BD800020C804D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크로~스!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
